{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22179","headline":"村中留李三固言宿 · 白居易","name":"村中留李三固言宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生早游宦，不道无亲故。\n如我与君心，相知应有数。\n春明门前别，金氏陂中遇。\n村酒两三杯，相留寒日暮。\n勿嫌村酒薄，聊酌论心素。\n请君少踟蹰，系马门前树。\n明年身若健，便拟江湖去。\n他日纵相思，知君无觅处。\n後会既茫茫，今宵君且住。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}